+## Board Publication
+
+Publishing a board makes it visible to anyone who knows its secret public URL, without signing in. Public visitors can see the board, its columns and its cards, but can't make any changes. Only administrators can publish or unpublish boards.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board, generating a secret public key for it.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board in the same shape as `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id`, including its `public_url`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "name": "Fizzy",
+  "all_access": true,
+  "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+  "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+  "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "public_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/public/boards/8FLxKbPz3pK5WqZ2dqvA3Hj6",
+  "creator": {
+    "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+    "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+    "role": "owner",
+    "active": true,
+    "email_address": "david@example.com",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+Publishing an already published board keeps its existing `public_url`.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board. Its public URL stops working immediately, and publishing the board again generates a new one.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+### Public URLs
+
+The public URL of a board (`/public/boards/:key`) renders a read-only HTML version of the board that requires neither an account nor authentication. Its columns and published cards can be opened directly at `/public/boards/:key/columns/:column_id` and `/public/boards/:key/cards/:card_number`.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
